*> vybe-test: cobol/level_numbers/test_level_three_nesting
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_level_numbers.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TOP.
   05 WS-MID.
      10 WS-BOT PIC X(3) VALUE "XYZ".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY WS-TOP.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-TOP DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "XYZ"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [XYZ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-MID.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-MID DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "XYZ"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [XYZ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-BOT.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-BOT DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "XYZ"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [XYZ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

